00:31:18.950 --> 00:31:21.620
That's the weird thing,
so that welcoming thing,

00:31:21.620 --> 00:31:23.800
it's like the Lefties can't
really let you see that,

00:31:23.800 --> 00:31:26.530
'cause if you see that, well,
